{"id":"076d46a23a3b6f81","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-set9-directed-union.md","title":"ZFC Set9 Directed Union","display":"df-zfc-set9-directed-union — ZFC Set9 Directed Union","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set9-directed-union","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set9-directed-union"],"display":"df-zfc-set9-directed-union — ZFC Set9 Directed Union","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set9-directed-union"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set9-directed-union</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set9-directed-union — ZFC Set9 Directed Union"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D,A,B,C\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal D,A,B,C\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet9DirectedUnion}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet9DirectedUnion}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}directed\\text{-}union} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet9DirectedUnion}_S(\\mathcal D)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathcal D\\neq\\emptyset\\land\n\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\exists C\\in\\mathcal D\\;(A\\cup B\\subseteq C)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}directed\\text{-}union} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet9DirectedUnion}_S(\\mathcal D)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathcal D\\neq\\emptyset\\land\n\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\exists C\\in\\mathcal D\\;(A\\cup B\\subseteq C)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>该谓词表达 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal D\\)</span> 对有限并的向上有向性；它不把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup\\mathcal D\">\\(\\bigcup\\mathcal D\\)</span> 本身误作额外参数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal D,A,B,C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet9DirectedUnion}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}directed\\text{-}union} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet9DirectedUnion}_S(\\mathcal D)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathcal D\\neq\\emptyset\\land\n\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\exists C\\in\\mathcal D\\;(A\\cup B\\subseteq C)\n\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigcup\\mathcal D","display":false}],"bytes":799,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3455","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-set9-directed-union.md|58-df-zfc-set9-directed-union]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":[]}